# Day 10 raw compact evidence is 125 MB and exceeds GitHub's single-file
# limit.  Audited manifests, per-rollout tables and derived statistics remain
# versioned under docs/paper/generated/day10/.
docs/paper/generated/day10/day10_formal_snapshot.tar.gz
docs/paper/generated/day10/day10_df_full.tar.gz
# Per-seed V3 held-out/calibration JSONs are retained locally and on the
# persistent server, but their compact audited summaries are versioned.
docs/paper/generated/capacity_history_v3/results/postprocess/heldout/
docs/paper/generated/capacity_history_v3/results/postprocess/calibration/
docs/paper/generated/capacity_history_v3/results/postprocess/latency/
*.ckpt
*.h5
*.pb
*.onnx
*.pt
*.pth

# Fine-tuned model outputs generated locally/on GPU servers.
core/scripts/models/*_carla_finetuned*/
